                "content": "# Enterprise Monitoring Overview\n\nThis dashboard tracks the migration status of Level 4 monitoring services and IDMZ remote access components.\n\n## Current monitored systems\n\n| System | IP Address | Zone | Role |\n|---|---:|---|---|\n| Backup Server | 10.10.4.107 | Level 4 - Enterprise | Backup repository |\n|DB/Grafana Server|10.10.4.108 | Level 4 - Enterprise | Monitoring / Inventory |\n| Jump Server | 10.10.35.120 | Level 3.5 - IDMZ | Jump server |\n| SCADA Operations | 10.10.3.10 | Level 3 - Operations | SCADA server |\n| I/O Server | 10.10.3.20 | Level 3 - Operations | Plant data collection |\n\nDirect access from Enterprise to OT systems should remain blocked.\n\nApproved access must be performed through the jump server.",
